#: model:ir.model.fields,help:cyllo_documents.field_document_workspace__privacy_visibility
msgid ""
"- Invited internal users: when following a workspace, internal users will get access to all of its documents without distinction \n"
"\n"
" All internal users: all internal users can access the workspace and all of its documents without distinction.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
